------SBIMSBoundary--

###############################################################

# FINAL DOCUMENT LIST

###############################################################

### Verify Final Internship Document State

###

### Expected:

### - HTTP 200

### - success = true

### - remaining documents are returned

GET {{apiUrl}}/documents/internship/{{internshipId}}

Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

###############################################################

# RESOURCE-LEVEL TESTS

###############################################################

### Expected for all tests below: 403 Forbidden

### Student Attempts to Access Another Student's Internship Documents
GET {{apiUrl}}/documents/internship/{{otherInternshipId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Faculty Adviser Attempts to Access Internship Documents Not Assigned to Them
GET {{apiUrl}}/documents/internship/{{otherInternshipId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{facultyToken}}

### HTE Supervisor Attempts to Access Internship Documents Not Assigned to Them
GET {{apiUrl}}/documents/internship/{{otherInternshipId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hteToken}}



### Faculty Adviser Attempts to Access Specific Document for an Internship Assigned to Another Adviser
GET {{apiUrl}}/documents/{{secondDocumentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{facultyToken}}

### HTE Supervisor Attempts to Access Specific Document for an Internship Assigned to Another HTE Supervisor
GET {{apiUrl}}/documents/{{secondDocumentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{hteToken}}



